      "id": "qingming-c3",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "清明是二十四节气中唯一演变为传统节日的节气（清明节）。寒食节的祭扫习俗在唐代并入清明。",
        "en": "Qingming is the only solar term that evolved into a major festival, absorbing Hanshi (Cold Food) tomb-sweeping customs during the Tang dynasty."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；日期经验因纬度而异"
