      "kind": "fact",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "古人记录的清明三候：「桐始华、田鼠化为鴽、虹始见」。桐花初放、虹霓初现。",
        "en": "Ancient texts: paulownia blooms, field mice transform into quails, rainbows first appear."
      },
      "region": [
